Package: haiburden
Title: Explore the Burden of Hospital Infections in Germany and Europe
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Chenghuiyu", "Fan", , "cfan0055@student.monash.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides published estimates of five hospital infections in
    Germany and the EU/EEA from 2011 to 2012. The estimates count cases,
    deaths and healthy years lost. The package includes plotting helpers
    and a Shiny app that shows how the ranking of infections changes with
    the measure.
